msgid "Note"
msgstr "Bemærkning"

msgid "Ticket payouts & event reports"
msgstr "Billetudbetalinger og begivenhedsrapporter"

msgid "Refreshes ticket event reports and pays out finished events through Stripe after the configured delay (Vis → Tickets → Event reports). Reports awaiting the Stripe balance are retried on the next run, and the report PDF is emailed to the configured receivers."
msgstr "Opdaterer billetbegivenhedsrapporter og udbetaler afholdte begivenheder via Stripe efter den indstillede forsinkelse (Vis → Billetter → Begivenhedsrapporter). Rapporter, der afventer Stripe-saldoen, forsøges igen ved næste kørsel, og rapport-PDF'en sendes til de indstillede modtagere."

msgid "Automatic payout is disabled. Reports refreshed: %d."
msgstr "Automatisk udbetaling er slået fra. Rapporter opdateret: %d."

msgid "Reports refreshed: %1$d. Payouts created: %2$d. Awaiting Stripe balance: %3$d. Errors: %4$d."
msgstr "Rapporter opdateret: %1$d. Udbetalinger oprettet: %2$d. Afventer Stripe-saldo: %3$d. Fejl: %4$d."

msgid "The report scan is not registered yet. Open Vis → Sync Jobs once to register it."
msgstr "Rapportscanningen er ikke registreret endnu. Åbn Vis → Sync Jobs én gang for at registrere den."

msgid "The report scan job is disabled. Enable “Ticket payouts & event reports” under Vis → Sync Jobs."
msgstr "Rapportscanningsjobbet er slået fra. Slå “Billetudbetalinger og begivenhedsrapporter” til under Vis → Sync Jobs."

msgid "The scan job is enabled and will be scheduled on the next admin request."
msgstr "Scanningsjobbet er slået til og bliver planlagt ved næste admin-forespørgsel."

msgid "Stripe mode"
msgstr "Stripe-tilstand"

msgid "Active Stripe mode: Live. Event reports and payouts below cover live payments only."
msgstr "Aktiv Stripe-tilstand: Live. Begivenhedsrapporter og udbetalinger herunder dækker kun live-betalinger."

msgid "Active Stripe mode: Test. Event reports and payouts below cover test payments only; test payouts move no real money and report emails are not sent."
msgstr "Aktiv Stripe-tilstand: Test. Begivenhedsrapporter og udbetalinger herunder dækker kun testbetalinger; testudbetalinger flytter ingen rigtige penge, og der sendes ingen rapport-e-mails."

msgid "This report belongs to Stripe %1$s mode, but the active mode is %2$s. Switch the mode under Vis → Tickets to pay it out."
msgstr "Denne rapport tilhører Stripe-tilstanden %1$s, men den aktive tilstand er %2$s. Skift tilstanden under Vis → Billetter for at udbetale den."

msgid "The site is in Stripe test mode. Report emails are sent only for live-mode reports."
msgstr "Siden er i Stripe-testtilstand. Rapport-e-mails sendes kun for rapporter i live-tilstand."

msgid "Ticket fees"
msgstr "Billetgebyrer"

msgid "Pass fee to buyers"
msgstr "Videregiv gebyret til købere"

msgid "Add a service fee to every checkout order (tickets, products and renewals)"
msgstr "Tilføj et servicegebyr til hver ordre (billetter, produkter og fornyelser)"

msgid "A single fee per order — never per item — paid by the buyer on top of the stated prices. It applies to all payment methods alike: a payment-specific surcharge would violate the Stripe rules in the EU. When disabled, the organisation covers the Stripe costs itself."
msgstr "Et samlet gebyr pr. ordre — aldrig pr. vare — som køberen betaler oveni de angivne priser. Gebyret gælder alle betalingsmetoder ens: et betalingsspecifikt tillæg ville stride mod Stripes EU-regler. Er det slået fra, er organisationen selv for posterne."

msgid "Fee basis per order (kr)"
msgstr "Gebyrgrundbeløb pr. ordre (kr)"

msgid "Flat amount added to every order. These figures are also used to estimate the Stripe fee in event reports when the exact fees cannot be read from Stripe."
msgstr "Fast tillæg til hver ordre. Tallene bruges også som estimat for Stripe-gebyret i begivenhedsrapporter, når de præcise gebyrer ikke kan læses fra Stripe."

msgid "Fee percent of order ( % )"
msgstr "Gebyrprocent af ordren (%)"

msgid "Percentage of the order subtotal, rounded up to whole øre, added together with the base amount."
msgstr "Procentdel af ordrens delsum, rundet op til hele øre, og lagt sammen med grundbeløbet."

msgid "Service fee"
msgstr "Servicegebyr"

msgid "Service fee (cents)"
msgstr "Servicegebyr (øre)"

msgid "Event reports (test)"
msgstr "Begivenhedsrapporter (test)"

msgid "Stripe mode: Live. Stripe actions use the live keys. Event reports show all orders regardless of mode; payouts are made from the live balance."
msgstr "Stripe-tilstand: Live. Stripe-handlinger bruger live-nøglerne. Begivenhedsrapporter viser alle ordrer uanset tilstand; udbetalinger sker fra live-saldoen."

msgid "Stripe mode: Test. Stripe actions use test keys only. Event reports and amounts are unaffected; a report containing live payments can only be paid out in Live mode. Report emails follow the cron test setting."
msgstr "Stripe-tilstand: Test. Stripe-handlinger bruger kun testnøgler. Begivenhedsrapporter og beløb påvirkes ikke; en rapport med live-betalinger kan kun udbetales i Live-tilstand. Rapport-e-mails følger cron-testindstillingen."

msgid "This report mixes Stripe test and live payments and cannot be paid out automatically."
msgstr "Denne rapport blander Stripe-test- og live-betalinger og kan ikke udbetales automatisk."

msgid "This report contains %1$s payments, but Vis Tickets is using %2$s Stripe keys. Switch the mode under Vis → Tickets to pay it out."
msgstr "Denne rapport indeholder %1$s-betalinger, men Vis Tickets bruger %2$s Stripe-nøgler. Skift tilstanden under Vis → Billetter for at udbetale den."

msgid "Cron test mode is enabled. Report emails are not sent while testing."
msgstr "Cron-testtilstand er slået til. Der sendes ikke rapport-e-mails under test."

msgid "Data coverage: %1$d events with confirmed orders, %2$d report rows. Reports are created from orders, not copied from Fjordglimt — if the event count is lower than expected, the ticket-sales import skipped orders (see its plan page: unmatched events / missing ticket types)."
msgstr "Datadækning: %1$d begivenheder med bekræftede ordrer, %2$d rapportrækker. Rapporter oprettes ud fra ordrer og kopieres ikke fra Fjordglimt — er antallet af begivenheder lavere end forventet, sprang billetsalgsimporten ordrer over (se dens plan-side: ikke-matcede begivenheder / manglende billettyper)."

msgid "Data coverage: %1$d events with confirmed orders, %2$d report rows. Order rows: %3$d (paid %4$d, refunded %5$d, free %6$d). Reports are built from these orders, not copied from Fjordglimt."
msgstr "Datadækning: %1$d begivenheder med bekræftede ordrer, %2$d rapportrækker. Ordrelinjer: %3$d (betalte %4$d, refunderede %5$d, gratis %6$d). Rapporter bygges ud fra disse ordrer og kopieres ikke fra Fjordglimt."

msgid "Database columns missing on the ticket orders table: %s. Load this page again once to apply the upgrade; if the message stays, the database user cannot alter tables."
msgstr "Databasekolonner mangler på billetordretabellen: %s. Indlæs siden igen én gang for at gennemføre opgraderingen; står beskeden stadig, kan databasebrugeren ikke ændre tabeller."

msgid "Last database error: %s"
msgstr "Seneste databasefejl: %s"

msgid "Recreate event reports now"
msgstr "Gendan begivenhedsrapporter nu"

msgid "Creates one report row per event with confirmed orders. No payouts are made and no emails are sent."
msgstr "Opretter én rapportrække pr. begivenhed med bekræftede ordrer. Der udbetales ikke, og der sendes ingen e-mails."

msgid "Event reports rebuilt from orders: %d report rows."
msgstr "Begivenhedsrapporter gendannet ud fra ordrer: %d rapportrækker."

